# Real Time Scene Understanding (Cursor)

For project-wide instructions, read [`copilot-instructions.md`](../../.github/copilot-instructions.md). Do not duplicate policy from that file.

## Cursor workflow

- Run commands from the repository root.
- Prefer `scripts/setup_env.sh`, `compose.yaml`, Docker Compose, the FastAPI `/api/...` routes, and the documented Python test workflow.
- Check `/api/health` and relevant container logs when debugging runtime behavior.
- Read the relevant future skill under `.github/skills/` when a task-specific procedure exists.
- Keep changes minimal and consistent with the touched area.
- Add focused tests and update documentation when behavior, configuration, or APIs change.
- Create commits or pull requests only when the user explicitly asks.